    {
      "level": 3,
      "title": "Version control procedure for documentation across all UcF platforms:",
      "content": [
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "- **1. File Naming Convention**",
        "- Follow the standard format:",
        "- [Company Prefix] [Dept.#].[Function#] [Task Identifier + Date]",
        "- **2. Documentation Requirements**",
        "- Maintain consistent documentation of all processes",
        "- Regular updates and task alignment in Notion",
        "- Include status, assigned personnel, and relevant tags within containers **3. Platform-Specific Procedures**",
        "- ClickUp: Track project progress and task updates",
        "- Notion: Store knowledge base materials and document templates",
        "- Link operational documents between ClickUp workflows and Notion documentation **4. Review Cycles**",
        "- Weekly: Track ClickUp progress and content updates",
        "- Monthly: Review service metrics",
        "- Quarterly: Update Notion documentation **5. Documentation Storage**",
        "- Maintain consistent folder structure across departments",
        "- Use standardized templates for documentation",
        "- Ensure cross-referencing between related departments",
        "- Keep naming conventions uniform across all platforms ---",
